{"type":"text","timestamp":1794529444237,"sessionID":"ses_e2db801a6ffedq2jGg0eorCLsO","part":{"id":"prt_1d24a3331002QEK38Y07rPaQzH","sessionID":"ses_e2db801a6ffedq2jGg0eorCLsO","messageID":"msg_1d24a255d001Rq0YNfjnxCag8D","type":"text","text":"T021 is done. `--backfill` is wired into the runner, the fixture and output logs exist, and both verify checks pass.\n\nFiles written:\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs` modified. Added `--backfill <run-log>` parsing, the `--out` requirement in mode selection, a `backfillLog` path calling `backfillRunLog` with `promptFor(rowId, resolve(dirname(run-log), G2_FIXTURE_DIRNAME))`, the usage lines and the dispatch.\n- `specs/.../010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/backfill-fixture.jsonl` created with the two lines for `cmd-create-agent-plain-tune-01` (first with `projectDir`, second with `locator` null).\n- `specs/.../010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/backfill-out.jsonl` created by the backfill run.\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ jq -c '{offerBackfilled, briefDelivered, offerError, has: has(\"offeredCommand\")}' $SP/backfill-out.jsonl\n{\"offerBackfilled\":true,\"briefDelivered\":\"unknown\",\"offerError\":null,\"has\":true}\n{\"offerBackfilled\":true,\"briefDelivered\":\"unknown\",\"offerError\":\"no_checkout\",\"has\":true}\n```\n\n```\n$ node $R --backfill $SP/backfill-fixture.jsonl --out $SP/backfill-fixture.jsonl; echo exit=$?\n{\"ok\":false,\"code\":\"same_path\",\"detail\":\".../scratch/backfill-fixture.jsonl: the backfill writes a new log\"}\nexit=2\n```\n\nThe success run also exited 0 with `{\"ok\":true,\"lines\":2,...}`, and `node --check` on the runner exits 0.\n\nNotes: the task named no test file, so none was run, and I did not tick the T021 checkbox. The runner diff also carries earlier wave work already present in the working tree (offer replay and brief on each line), which I left untouched.","time":{"start":1794529440561,"end":1794529444237}}}
